{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111260","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1211126001:0":{"text":"……昔、オヤジは海から帰ってくるたびに、俺に色んな話を聞かせてくれたんだ。","source_cn":"……以前，老爹每次出海回来，都会给我讲故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C2D5596078EF610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211126002:0":{"text":"大海賊を倒したことや、数え切れないほどの宝を手に入れたこととか……","source_cn":"在故事里，他击退了大海盗，获得了无数神奇的宝藏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB8C8DB07EB7974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211126003:0":{"text":"今思えば、どれも子供だましの作り話だけどよ、あの頃の俺は全部信じてたよ。","source_cn":"根本就是为了哄我随口胡编的谎话，我却全都信了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97702A36A3083D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211126004:0":{"text":"唯一まともな服があのチョッキで……ボロボロの羅針盤を使い続けて、嵐だろうと構わず船を出してた……","source_cn":"那家伙，明明只有一件还算像样的马甲……连个新的罗盘都舍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8E016CB13FC0A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211126005:0":{"text":"どうして突然お父さんのお話を……？","source_cn":"怎么突然讲起你父亲的事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC05415A5A801F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211126006:0":{"text":"これは……オヤジがお守り代わりに使ってた羅針盤なんだ。","source_cn":"因为……这是我老爹当年用过的罗盘，是他的护身符。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36BA87E3F58B1BD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211126007:0":{"text":"つまりこれは……お父さんの形見？","source_cn":"哎？竟然是你父亲的……遗物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150EAE6BBF99C0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211126008:0":{"text":"おバカロンロン！何無神経なこと言ってるのよ！","source_cn":"嘘——笨蛋满满！别说这些，他会伤心的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDBEEA7C430086C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::0":{"text":"羅針盤","source_cn":"罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF68A0B410B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211126009:0":{"text":"気にするな。オヤジのお守りが、こうして形見になったのは事実なんだ。","source_cn":"也没什么好忌讳的。这本来是他的护身符，却成了他的遗物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8001624E1D55472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211126010:0":{"text":"あの日、海はかなり荒れてた。子どもなりに何か感じたのか、俺は出発しようとするオヤジを泣きながら止めたんだ。","source_cn":"他离开我的那天，天气很不好。或许是直觉，我哭闹着不让他走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD996C26EF081DAFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211126011:0":{"text":"そしたら、オヤジはこの羅針盤を俺に見せて言ったんだ、「これは船長である俺の任務だ――」","source_cn":"他把这个罗盘拿出来，告诉我，伟大的船长要去执行任务了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88C2328CAAA14602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211126012:0":{"text":"「そして、副船長のお前の任務は、俺が戻るまで家で待っていること。無事に任務を遂行した暁には――」","source_cn":"作为他的大副，我要执行的任务就是乖乖在家待着。等到他回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8CE0C73AAFDDEB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211126013:0":{"text":"「この羅針盤と、俺の『名』を継がせてやる。お互い頑張ろうぜ、未来のシンドバッド船長」ってな。","source_cn":"到那时，我就会继承他的名号，成为伟大的——辛巴达船长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2671C82D3AF4C065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211126014:0":{"text":"……それっきり、オヤジは帰ってこなかった。\nオヤジの船も、羅針盤も、俺が見送った背中も、遠い海の彼方に消えちまったんだ。","source_cn":"但是他再也没有回来。\\n他的船，他的罗盘，他的身影，都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B3309A3015DBE3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211126015:0":{"text":"ほんっと、最低だよな！夢のためなら、子どもでも何でも置いてっちまうんだからよ！","source_cn":"差劲的家伙！为了梦想， 他什么都能抛下！包括我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6EC71260C0F8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211126016:0":{"text":"でも俺は、それでもやっぱ……<style=\"highlight\">オヤジみたいな人間</style>になりたいんだ。","source_cn":"可归根结底……我还是想要<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x686466C34286F243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1211126016":{"text":"でも俺は、それでもやっぱ……<style=\"highlight\">オヤジみたいな人間</style>になりたいんだ。","source_cn":"可归根结底……我还是想要<style=highlight>成为他那样的人</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x686466C34286F243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211126017:0":{"text":"それにしても、この俺が仲間と冒険して、試練を乗り越えて、財宝を見つけるなんてな。もしオヤジが知ったら……","source_cn":"我竟然也成为了故事中的人，我们一起冒险、通过试炼、找到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB600D2F76A63CBC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211126018:0":{"text":"なあ、タシー。\n一つ聞いてもいいか？なんでオヤジの羅針盤がここにあるんだ？","source_cn":"塔西——\\n那个，我能问一嘴吗？我老爹的罗盘，为什么会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08435065475D2430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211126019:0":{"text":"それは妖精の秘密よ。","source_cn":"这是妖精的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34DB65ABDB9980B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211126020:0":{"text":"でも一つ教えてあげる。この羅針盤は、あなたのお父さんの形見であって形見ではないの。これには、浪と漂流の神の力が宿っているのよ。","source_cn":"不过，它既是你父亲的遗物，也不是你父亲的遗物。因为那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135838C27115B328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1211126021:0":{"text":"テルミリウス様が亡くなったあと、ほとんどの力は世界に帰ったけど、ごく一部の力は目的もなく漂っていたの、この羅針盤が来るまではね。","source_cn":"他陨落后，大多数的力量都已经归还世界，少许力量如浮萍般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BB6CFA0C6D67D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1211126022:0":{"text":"羅針盤にテルミリウス様の力が？それ、俺にも使えるのか？","source_cn":"罗盘上竟然有特勒米琉斯的力量？我能使用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254B4DBE798B0C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1211126023:0":{"text":"それはあなた次第よ。","source_cn":"要看你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD690712BEE6FE286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1211126024:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">あなた</style>が、遙か遠くの